# Google Maps Platform key with the Solar API + Geocoding API enabled.
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com → APIs & Services → Credentials.
# Enable: "Solar API" and "Geocoding API". Google Maps gives ~$200/mo free credit.
# Local dev: put the real value in a .env file (gitignored). Production: set it as a
# Cloudflare Pages environment variable of the same name.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Anthropic API key — powers the REAL Ovi operator (Claude drives the CRM via tools).
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com → Settings → API Keys (starts "sk-ant-...").
# Local dev: put the real value in .env (gitignored) and restart `npm run dev`.
# Production: set it as a Cloudflare Pages environment variable of the same name.
# Without it, the app falls back to the built-in deterministic Ovi engine.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional — override the model (default: claude-opus-5). e.g. claude-sonnet-5 for lower cost.
OVI_MODEL=
